<section class="section">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="card border-[var(--alert-red)]/20 bg-[#fdf6f5]">
        <p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--alert-red)]">If nothing changes</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 font-sans font-bold text-xl text-[var(--ink)]">The cycle keeps spinning</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">
          You stay quiet. The guilt returns. Your curious friend never gets invited. And the people in your life keep wondering about God with no safe place to ask out loud.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card border-[var(--lime)]/40 bg-[var(--lime-light)]">
        <p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--dark-teal)]">What success looks like</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 font-sans font-bold text-xl text-[var(--ink)]">More Jesus. Less awkward.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">
          You talk about faith without dreading it. You invite without cornering anyone. You trust God with the results and love the person in front of you, whether they ever believe or not.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
